<title>USA: FMR group lifts stake in Revco.</title>
<headline>FMR group lifts stake in Revco.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by FMR Corp said in a Securities and Exchange Commission filing Monday it raised its stake in Revco D.S. Inc to 7,228,670 common shares or 10.61 percent from 8.84 percent held in May.</p>
<p>The group disclosed its latest position on Revco in a 13G filing. FMR Corp is the parent of the investment adviser to Fidelity Funds.</p>
<p>Filings under 13G are usually made by institutions and large investors with &quot;passive&quot; investment objectives in a company. Unlike 13D filings, those reports do not list the latest transactions.</p>
</text>
